01:38:06.780 --> 01:38:10.620
and have this privilege and
honor to make this announcement.

01:38:10.620 --> 01:38:15.620
Nothing could be better as a
start for my deanship here.

01:38:15.720 --> 01:38:20.250
So we would like to make the announcement

01:38:20.250 --> 01:38:23.820
about just recently an anonymous donor

01:38:23.820 --> 01:38:28.140
has recently finalized a
very, very generous gift

01:38:28.140 --> 01:38:32.880
to Yale School of Nursing
in honor of our centennial.

01:38:32.880 --> 01:38:36.870
And the gift will directly
impact the students.

01:38:36.870 --> 01:38:39.057
We talked about, you know,

01:38:39.057 --> 01:38:41.190
the debt and the cost of the education

01:38:41.190 --> 01:38:44.640
and those type of gifts are so amazing

01:38:44.640 --> 01:38:48.030
and so transformative
for us to be able to,

01:38:48.030 --> 01:38:53.030
not only attract the highly
qualified nursing students,

01:38:55.590 --> 01:38:58.953
but also really diversify our programs.

01:38:59.790 --> 01:39:04.230
So this gift will be an endowment

01:39:04.230 --> 01:39:09.230
to provide six full ride
scholarship every year,

01:39:10.050 --> 01:39:12.030
starting from this year.

01:39:12.030 --> 01:39:15.720
So it's nothing no promise for future,

01:39:15.720 --> 01:39:19.260
but right now we can use it.

01:39:19.260 --> 01:39:23.670
And this is the largest single
donation we have received

01:39:23.670 --> 01:39:25.530
in the Yale School of Nursing.

01:39:25.530 --> 01:39:29.670
And the total gift is $11.1 million.

01:39:32.094 --> 01:39:35.344
(audience applauding)

01:39:46.500 --> 01:39:50.400
So of course I'm very
happy and very excited

01:39:50.400 --> 01:39:52.380
about this wonderful opportunity.

01:39:52.380 --> 01:39:56.070
But I would like to thank
everyone else beside me,

01:39:56.070 --> 01:39:59.842
