01:45:38.250 --> 01:45:42.810
I would like to thank
both our special guests.

01:45:42.810 --> 01:45:44.910
Thank you very much for carving out

01:45:44.910 --> 01:45:46.890
of your very, very busy time

01:45:46.890 --> 01:45:49.650
to come here and have
this wonderful discussion.

01:45:49.650 --> 01:45:54.650
This is a great initiation
of our yearlong celebration.

01:45:55.830 --> 01:45:58.560
So Dr. Shah, if you join me now here,

01:45:58.560 --> 01:46:03.213
so that I could present with
you a small token of here,

01:46:04.830 --> 01:46:08.502
our appreciation for your time here.

01:46:08.502 --> 01:46:09.380
Thank you very much.

01:46:09.380 --> 01:46:10.513
- Thank you.

01:46:10.513 --> 01:46:14.287
(audience applauding)

01:46:14.287 --> 01:46:16.564
- Thank you very much. Exactly.

01:46:16.564 --> 01:46:18.069
- Oh wow.

01:46:18.069 --> 01:46:21.236
(audience applauding)

01:46:22.500 --> 01:46:23.333
Thank you.

01:46:25.647 --> 01:46:28.230
(gentle music)

